    "head_branch": "feature/crate-checks-alone",
    "head_commit_message": "refactor(ci): checks on the crate's binaries alone (spec 39 step 9d-iii)\n\nThe GDScript digest, trials, benches, scaling_check, tick_phases and the\nreplay are retired. CI's digests, trials and scaling jobs run the crate's\nbinaries with no Godot, and the bench runs only breach_* binaries.\n\n- breach_digest gains trace=, from= and to= (digest::trace), the\n  GDScript digest's outcome trace; snapshot= went with it (cuts= took\n  its place in step 8d).\n- digest::battle and digest::field hand each tick over as a Told; its\n  record() writes the same bytes, so the digests are unchanged.\n- trace_changed.sh traces each side with its own breach_digest.\n- run_benches.ps1 runs the crate's binaries; build.ps1 copies them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi2Q8hNPHGfK5CD21FZ",
